  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PlantwisePlus scale-out strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The PlantwisePlus goal: Smallholder farmers produce more food using safer and sustainable crop production practices, thereby improving food security and rural livelihoods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This will be achieved by supporting countries to predict, prevent and prepare themselves for plant health threats in the face of a changing climate. This in turn will ensure that farmers reduce their crop losses and produce more and safer food using practices that safeguard human health and the environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The PlantwisePlus programme will be implemented through three impact pathways:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;Pest preparedness: to coordinate and strengthen systems for detection and response to pest outbreaks&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;Pesticide risk reduction: to increase awareness of, access to and use of affordable integrated pest management solutions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;Farmer advisory services: to enhance knowledge and uptake of integrated pest management practices through responsive digital and non-digital approaches&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
